                                "sense_id": "7e126933-17fd-33d1-b070-dc4718cbfe92",
                                "text": "She moved back to the table, and her busyness expressed her purpose but also perhaps hid some sort of regret at the news."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "922a477c-2dee-4ecd-b74f-73a85a38b93d",
                                "sense_id": "7e126933-17fd-33d1-b070-dc4718cbfe92",
                                "text": "A world without rigid temporal boundaries gave some a rare chance to relax and regroup after many years of busyness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b392a7c-a3e2-4358-8cbb-c031f15e4010",
                                "sense_id": "7e126933-17fd-33d1-b070-dc4718cbfe92",
                                "text": "The actor has also visited acupuncture and massage therapists more regularly to prime her body for the busyness of her schedule."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
